---
layout: base.njk
title: Photos
permalink: /gallery/
description: "Every DC Social Collective night in photos, from the first picnic in 2021 to the latest ball."
---
<div class="wrap page-head">
  <h1>Photos</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ collections.albums.length }} albums and {{ collections.albums | photoCount }} photos, from the first picnic in 2021 to the latest ball. More on <a href="{{ site.instagram }}">Instagram</a>.</p>
</div>
<section class="band" style="padding-top:1.5rem">
  <div class="wrap albums">
  {%- for a in collections.albums %}
    <a class="album" href="{{ a.url }}">
      {% if a.data.coverImage %}<img src="{{ a.data.coverImage }}" alt="" loading="{% if loop.index0 < 6 %}eager{% else %}lazy{% endif %}">{% endif %}
      <div><h2>{{ a.data.title }}</h2><p>{{ a.data.day | fullDate }}</p></div>
    </a>
  {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
